  | C4_reason_block    | pure-CSL  | 1.039 / 1.039 / 1.039     |  ≤ 1.5 |
  | C5_bridge_mode     | bridge    | 1.029 / 1.029 / 1.029     |  ≤ 1.2 |
  | C6_slot_grammar    | pure-CSL  | 1.038 / 1.038 / 1.038     |  ≤ 1.5 |
  | C7_morpheme_stack  | pure-CSL  | 1.014 / 1.014 / 1.014     |  ≤ 1.5 |
  all-21 within stratified targets ; CI tight (bootstrap=200 ; widen to 1000 for publication)
  note : mock backend is deterministic + model-independent → all 3 columns identical ←
         real-backend runs (via scripts/m2_install_models.sh) will show inter-model variance

§§ COMPARISON HARNESS RESULTS
  | notation | char-compression | token-compression |
  |----------|------------------|-------------------|
  | csl      | 0.633            | 0.632             |
  | apl      | 0.168            | 0.176             |
  | lojban   | 0.379            | 0.379             |
  | prose    | 1.000            | 1.000             |
  CSL ≈ 37% reduction vs prose on spec-domain content (5 reference passages)
  APL denser (but opaque) ; Lojban notably-dense (though CJK-like NLL hit)
  caveat : NLL column reflects LLM-familiarity, not density ← documented

