§ ARCHITECTURE-NOTES-APPLIED
  Dual-backend (real + mock)        ← fast CI + publishable research runs share code
  Backend-aware thresholds          ← fallback cosine/recall calibrated separately
  Python-native Ed25519 audit-chain ← self-contained, no parser.exe dep
  Bootstrap-percentile 95% CI       ← publication-standard non-parametric
  Stratified targets matching m₁    ← consistent methodology across metrics
  ADDITIVE-only v1.0 protection     ← zero file modifications to v1.0 surfaces
  Prose-caveat on APL/Lojban comparison ← anti-benchmark-theater
  Genesis-entry chain seed          ← parallels smt_audit/Session-7 pattern
  BLAKE3 cache-keying               ← content-addr + deterministic
  Reproducibility (R16) anchors     ← seed+SHA pinning in every cert

